- Use design-direction (Design Kit) to set the visual direction and DESIGN.md
  tokens, and Taste (`design-taste-frontend`, Skill Starter Kit) to build it.
- Use this skill to test the already-rendered result, and browser-verify
  (Skill Starter Kit) to drive the browser.
- Use test-driven-development / verify-gate (Skill Starter Kit) for a full test
  strategy; this skill supplies the rendered visual evidence inside it.
